WEBVTT

00:02.669 --> 00:03.461
Captioning Provided By:
MTV Networks
字幕提供者：
MTV网络

00:03.545 --> 00:04.337
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:04.421 --> 00:05.338
Kids: Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：是的，是的，队长。

00:05.422 --> 00:06.464
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.548 --> 00:08.466
Kids: Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：是啊是啊，队长！

00:08.550 --> 00:11.136
Captain: ♪ Ohh... ♪
队长：♪ 哦...♪

00:11.219 --> 00:13.638
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.722 --> 00:15.640
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.724 --> 00:17.642
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.726 --> 00:19.394
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.477 --> 00:21.688
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.771 --> 00:23.398
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.481 --> 00:25.567
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.650 --> 00:27.026
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.110 --> 00:28.236
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:28.319 --> 00:29.612
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.696 --> 00:31.698
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.781 --> 00:33.575
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.658 --> 00:37.245
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:55.638 --> 01:00.185
SpongeBob and Patrick:
♪ ...Krabby Patty,
Krabby Patty, Krabby Patty ♪
海绵宝宝和帕特里克：
♪ ...螃蟹帕蒂，
蟹肉饼 蟹肉饼 ♪

01:00.268 --> 01:06.441
♪ Squidward had a Krabby Patty
whose buns were white as snow ♪
♪ 章鱼哥吃了蟹肉饼
他的馒头白得像雪一样♪

01:08.818 --> 01:10.653
Welcome to the Krusty Krab
欢迎来到蟹堡王

01:10.737 --> 01:13.615
where it's almost as if
the evolutionary clock
ticks backward.
几乎就像
进化时钟
向后滴答作响。

01:13.698 --> 01:16.785
♪ ...Squidward had
a Krabby Patty... ♪
♪ ...章鱼哥有
蟹肉饼...♪

01:16.868 --> 01:18.620
Excuse me for just a second.
请原谅我一下。

01:18.703 --> 01:20.330
♪ ...as snow ♪
♪ ...如雪 ♪

01:20.413 --> 01:24.292
Do you mind, I'm trying to work
at a fast food restaurant.
你介意吗，我正在努力工作
在一家快餐店。

01:24.375 --> 01:26.377
You might want to
try it some time!
你可能想要
尝试一下！

01:26.461 --> 01:28.505
I sure would, Squidward,
that sounds-
我当然会的，章鱼哥，
听起来——

01:28.588 --> 01:30.256
Hey, wait a minute.
嘿，等一下。

01:30.340 --> 01:34.427
SpongeBob, you already  do
work at a fast food restaurant.
海绵宝宝，你已经这么做了
在一家快餐店工作。

01:34.511 --> 01:35.804
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

01:35.887 --> 01:37.222
Yay!
耶！

01:37.305 --> 01:39.182
Remind me to fire my therapist.
提醒我解雇我的治疗师。

01:39.265 --> 01:42.101
And stop bringing
your neighbors to work.
并且停止携带
你的邻居去上班。

01:42.185 --> 01:43.603
Patrick: We're not
just neighbors.
帕特里克：我们不是
只是邻居。

01:43.686 --> 01:44.729
SpongeBob: You can
say that again.
海绵宝宝：你可以的
再说一遍。

01:44.813 --> 01:46.064
Patrick: We're not just-
帕特里克：我们不只是——

01:46.147 --> 01:48.733
Squidward: I don't care!
章鱼哥：我不在乎！

01:51.194 --> 01:53.905
♪ Krabby Patty, Krabby Patty,
Krabby Patty... ♪
♪ 蟹黄派蒂，蟹黄派蒂，
蟹黄派蒂...♪

01:56.241 --> 01:57.784
All right!
好的！

01:57.867 --> 02:00.495
I am gonna- well, I don't know
what I'm gonna do, but-
我会——好吧，我不知道
我要做什么，但是-

02:00.578 --> 02:03.122
♪ She'll be coming around the
Krabby Patty when she comes ♪
♪ 她会过来
蟹蟹帕蒂来了♪

02:04.666 --> 02:08.378
SpongeBob, you nincompoop,
you broke my face.
海绵宝宝，你这个笨蛋，
你伤了我的脸。

02:08.461 --> 02:11.047
Don't just stand there, help me.
别只是站在那儿，帮帮我吧。

02:11.131 --> 02:12.882
I need a doctor.
我需要一名医生。

02:14.551 --> 02:15.885
Woman: Doctor's office.
女：医生办公室。

02:15.969 --> 02:18.471
Woman: You have a visitor
in the main lobby.
女：有客人来了
在主大堂。

02:18.555 --> 02:20.932
Woman: Dr. Kravitz...
女人：克拉维茨博士……

02:23.059 --> 02:25.478
SpongeBob: Oh, Doctor, is he
gonna be all right?
海绵宝宝：噢，博士，他是吗？
会没事的吗？

02:25.562 --> 02:28.106
For the love of Neptune,
tell me.
为了海王星的爱，
告诉我。

02:28.189 --> 02:29.649
Well, son-
好吧，儿子——

02:29.732 --> 02:31.109
No, don't tell me!
不，别告诉我！

02:31.192 --> 02:32.986
I can't take it.
我受不了。

02:35.280 --> 02:36.865
We should know-
我们应该知道——

02:36.948 --> 02:39.033
No, no, please,
just, just don't.
不，不，拜托，
只是，只是不要。

02:39.117 --> 02:42.620
We won't know for two weeks,
you'll just have to wait.
两周后我们才知道
你只需要等待。

02:42.704 --> 02:45.874
Two weeks, I'll never make it.
两周，我永远也到不了。

02:47.834 --> 02:50.712
Mornin', SpongeBob,
you're early today.
早安，海绵宝宝，
你今天来早了。

02:50.795 --> 02:52.213
Good morning, Nurse Wretched.
早上好，可怜的护士。

02:52.297 --> 02:54.173
Hi, Mabel, saved the blue one
just for you.
嗨，梅布尔，救了蓝色的
只为你。

02:54.257 --> 02:58.344
Oh, SpongeBob,
blue is my favorite color.
哦，海绵宝宝，
蓝色是我最喜欢的颜色。

02:58.428 --> 03:00.638
Uh, or is it orange?
呃，还是橙色的？

03:02.974 --> 03:05.518
I'll bet your amnesia's
gonna wear off in no time.
我敢打赌你有健忘症
很快就会消失。

03:05.602 --> 03:06.519
My what?
我的什么？

03:06.603 --> 03:07.979
Hi ya, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

03:08.062 --> 03:10.315
I've been practicing
how to flop on my back.
我一直在练习
如何仰面翻倒。

03:11.858 --> 03:13.693
We can't really
have you in here today.
我们真的不能
你今天在吗？

03:13.776 --> 03:15.361
I'm going to be removing
Squidward's bandages
我要删除
章鱼哥的绷带

03:15.445 --> 03:18.489
and he made me swear to
keep you far away from him.
他让我发誓
让你远离他。

03:18.573 --> 03:20.241
It has been two weeks already?
已经两周了？

03:20.325 --> 03:22.243
Don't worry, Doc, I promise
to stay out of the way.
别担心，医生，我保证
不碍事。

03:22.327 --> 03:26.372
OK, as long as you stay
on the other side of the-
好吧，只要你留下来
在另一边-

03:31.836 --> 03:33.087
Don't  rush  it.
别着急。

03:33.171 --> 03:35.298
Sorry, go ahead.
抱歉，请继续。

03:36.466 --> 03:37.884
SpongeBob: Wait!
海绵宝宝：等等！

03:37.967 --> 03:40.553
Are you sure the patient has
enough  ?
你确定病人有
够了吗？

03:40.637 --> 03:43.473
I have no idea what that is.
我不知道那是什么。

03:43.556 --> 03:45.433
Please, just let me work.
请让我工作吧。

03:45.516 --> 03:47.143
Very well, Doctor, carry on.
很好，博士，继续。

03:47.226 --> 03:49.395
May I?
我可以？

03:49.479 --> 03:53.399
Hold it, the readings on this
brain meter are all wrong,
we must postpone the operation.
坚持住，阅读这方面的内容
脑力计都错了
我们必须推迟手术。

03:53.483 --> 03:56.903
That is a television set
put here for the
patients' enjoyment.
那是一台电视机
放在这里是为了
患者的享受。

03:56.986 --> 03:58.905
And it's not even
plugged into the wall.
而且这还不是
插在墙上。

03:58.988 --> 04:02.951
You're right, Doctor,
proceed with Operation: Sever.
你说得对，医生，
继续操作：切断。

04:03.660 --> 04:05.286
SpongeBob: Hold it!
海绵宝宝：坚持住！

04:05.370 --> 04:07.246
Woman: Doctor, we can't do this.
女：医生，我们不能这样做。

04:07.330 --> 04:09.374
Surely we can use
a less-dangerous procedure.
当然我们可以使用
危险性较小的程序。

04:09.457 --> 04:13.795
After all, we have to start
thinking about the welfare of-
毕竟我们必须开始
考虑以下人员的福利——

04:14.504 --> 04:16.506
SpongeBob: Wait!
海绵宝宝：等等！

04:16.589 --> 04:20.635
I just wanted to say sorry
for interrupting you before.
我只是想说声抱歉
因为之前打扰了你。

04:28.142 --> 04:30.311
I, I...
我，我……

04:30.395 --> 04:31.604
I can't believe it.
我简直不敢相信。

04:32.647 --> 04:33.523
Squidward: SpongeBob?
章鱼哥：海绵宝宝？

04:33.606 --> 04:34.524
Yeah?
是的？

04:34.607 --> 04:36.359
Squidward: How does it look?
章鱼哥：看起来怎么样？

04:36.442 --> 04:37.777
Great Neptune.
伟大的海王星。

04:37.860 --> 04:39.362
Squidward: Come on,
spit it out, I can take it.
章鱼哥：来吧，
吐出来吧，我能接受。

04:39.445 --> 04:44.200
Time for your medicine, mister-
mister... mister...
是时候该吃药了，先生——
先生……先生……

04:44.283 --> 04:45.410
Handsome.
英俊的。

04:45.493 --> 04:46.536
Ooh...
哦...

04:46.619 --> 04:47.745
Squidward: What did she call me?
章鱼哥：她叫我什么？

04:47.829 --> 04:49.038
Handsome, but she
spelled it wrong.
很帅，但是她
拼写错误。

04:49.122 --> 04:51.833
Squidward: Quick,
hand me that mirror.
章鱼哥：快点，
把那面镜子递给我。

04:52.625 --> 04:53.751
What the-
什么-

04:53.835 --> 04:56.504
Wait a second...
等一下...

04:56.587 --> 04:58.256
That nurse was right.
那位护士说得对。

04:58.339 --> 05:00.717
I  am  handsome.
我很帅。

05:00.800 --> 05:02.760
Eh, Squidward,
you're not handsome.
呃，章鱼哥，
你不帅。

05:02.844 --> 05:05.263
You're a hunk!
你真是个猛男！

05:12.770 --> 05:15.732
So handsome.
好帅啊

05:16.566 --> 05:18.234
Handsome.
英俊的。

05:21.738 --> 05:23.656
Hello, handsome.
你好，帅哥。

05:25.783 --> 05:29.996
SpongeBob: Gee, Squidward,
people really seem to be
noticing how handsome
you are now.
海绵宝宝：哎呀，章鱼哥，
人们似乎真的是
注意到有多帅
你现在是。

05:30.079 --> 05:32.832
You might even  more
handsome than before.
你甚至可能
比以前帅了。

05:32.915 --> 05:34.667
Oh, so handsome.
哦，太帅了。

05:34.751 --> 05:37.003
If that's even possible.
如果可能的话。

05:39.464 --> 05:43.092
It's a miracle, I can walk.
我能走路了，真是个奇迹。

05:44.260 --> 05:45.428
I can see.
我可以看到。

05:45.511 --> 05:47.430
I can fly.
我能飞。

05:48.514 --> 05:51.768
Uh-oh, my shoe's untied.
呃哦，我的鞋带解开了。

05:54.020 --> 05:57.565
Mr. Handsome, can I
have your autograph?
帅哥先生可以吗
有你的签名吗？

05:57.648 --> 06:01.694
No, not the book,
on my retainer.
不，不是书，
在我的保持器上。

06:02.612 --> 06:04.614
Both: A limousine?
两人：一辆豪华轿车？

06:07.283 --> 06:11.954
Well, SpongeBob, earlier today,
my spine was hurting.
好吧，海绵宝宝，今天早些时候，
我的脊椎很痛。

06:12.038 --> 06:15.833
But now I'm resting on
fine, leather upholstery.
但现在我正在休息
精美的皮革内饰。

06:22.799 --> 06:24.842
Well, I'm gonna go
clip my toenails, Squidward.
Well, I'm gonna go
剪我的脚趾甲，章鱼哥。

06:24.926 --> 06:26.719
Don't forget to
enjoy being handsome.
别忘了
享受帅气。

06:26.803 --> 06:28.221
Oh, don't worry.
哦，别担心。

06:33.017 --> 06:35.103
Handsome, handsome, handsome...
帅啊帅啊帅啊……

06:37.647 --> 06:42.235
Handsome, handsome, handsome...
帅啊帅啊帅啊……

06:42.318 --> 06:44.779
Gee, huh?
哎呀，是吗？

06:46.739 --> 06:50.493
Well, better go
greet the commoners.
好吧，最好走
向平民问好。

06:50.576 --> 06:53.371
Handsome, handsome, handsome...
帅啊帅啊帅啊……

06:53.454 --> 06:55.414
Good morning, my people.
早上好，我的人民。

06:55.498 --> 06:58.042
I'm sorry to have
kept you waiting, but
我很遗憾有
让你久等了，但是

06:58.126 --> 07:00.586
even I,  ,
strange as it seems
连我也,,
看起来很奇怪

07:00.670 --> 07:02.338
need my beauty sleep.
需要我的美容觉。

07:02.421 --> 07:03.673
I want his shirt.
我想要他的衬衫。

07:03.756 --> 07:05.341
I want his eyelids.
我想要他的眼皮。

07:08.594 --> 07:11.389
I guess I kept them waiting
a little too long.
我想我让他们久等了
有点太长了。

07:11.472 --> 07:13.057
I know.
我知道。

07:13.141 --> 07:15.518
A little music should
soothe their hunger.
应该放一点音乐
缓解他们的饥饿。

07:15.601 --> 07:19.939
Crowd: Handsome, handsome,
handsome, handsome...
人群：帅帅帅帅
帅哥，帅哥……

07:20.857 --> 07:23.067
Hey, what is that sound?
嘿，那是什么声音？

07:23.151 --> 07:26.404
Wait, it's him,
the handsome man!
等等，是他，
英俊的男人！

07:31.784 --> 07:35.496
Beautiful  and  talented,
what more do they want?
美丽又才华横溢，
他们还想要什么？

07:35.580 --> 07:39.709
Don't worry, folks, there's more
where that came from, and-
各位别担心，还有更多
那是从哪里来的，并且-

07:39.792 --> 07:40.710
Hey!
嘿！

07:40.793 --> 07:42.211
I got the clarinet.
我拿到了单簧管。

07:50.052 --> 07:54.307
There's nothing a little
foaming, herbal bath can't cure.
没有一点什么
起泡沫，药草浴无法治愈。

07:54.390 --> 07:56.601
Hey, my grandmother
gave me that soap.
嘿，我的祖母
给了我那块肥皂。

07:56.684 --> 08:02.857
Well, no one ever said it'd be
easy being so handsome, Squiddy.
好吧，从来没有人说过它会是
鱿鱼，这么帅很容易。

08:02.940 --> 08:05.151
You'll just have to start
getting used-
你只需要开始
习惯了-

08:06.485 --> 08:07.320
Hi, handsome.
嗨，帅哥。

08:07.403 --> 08:08.779
Handsome.
英俊的。

08:08.863 --> 08:09.739
Handsome.
英俊的。

08:09.822 --> 08:10.656
Augh.
啊啊。

08:10.740 --> 08:11.657
Let's get him.
我们来抓住他吧。

08:17.580 --> 08:18.581
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

08:20.082 --> 08:21.209
You gotta help me.
你得帮助我。

08:21.292 --> 08:22.627
They stole my bubble bath.
他们偷了我的泡泡浴。

08:22.710 --> 08:25.713
Public life ain't all
it's cracked up to be.
公共生活不是全部
据推测是这样的。

08:25.796 --> 08:27.840
I want my old life back.
我想要回到以前的生活。

08:27.924 --> 08:30.384
Hmm, I know just what to do.
嗯，我知道该怎么做了。

08:41.437 --> 08:43.981
Mr. Krabs: Squidward,
what have you done?
蟹老板：章鱼哥，
你做了什么？

08:44.065 --> 08:47.068
You know what the Krusty Krab
means to me, don't you?
你知道蟹堡王是什么吗
对我来说意味着，不是吗？

08:47.151 --> 08:50.112
And you took it upon yourself
to bring all these...
而你自己承担了这一切
把这些都带来...

08:50.196 --> 08:54.033
these customers to me.
这些客户给我。

08:54.116 --> 08:55.910
Hey, don't worry, folks.
嘿，别担心，伙计们。

08:55.993 --> 08:57.536
There's plenty of Squidward
to go around
章鱼哥有很多
四处走走

08:57.620 --> 08:59.872
so everybody just line up
and get your pocketbooks out.
所以大家就排队
拿出你的钱包。

08:59.956 --> 09:02.750
For a small fee
of $14.98 per person
只需支付少量费用
每人 14.98 美元

09:02.833 --> 09:07.713
everyone will get the
opportunity to touch Squidward.
每个人都会得到
有机会接触章鱼哥。

09:07.797 --> 09:09.131
We don't have much time.
我们没有太多时间。

09:09.215 --> 09:10.883
Take the door
and change me back.
拿门去
并把我变回来。

09:10.967 --> 09:13.803
And I'll even throw in
a free soft drink
for an extra $3.
我什至会投入
一杯免费软饮料
额外支付 3 美元。

09:13.886 --> 09:17.306
Come on, SpongeBob,
take the door and
smash my face back.
来吧，海绵宝宝，
开门并
打碎我的脸。

09:17.390 --> 09:18.432
I can't.
我不能。

09:18.516 --> 09:20.017
It was one thing
doing it by accident
这是一回事
无意中做的

09:20.101 --> 09:21.560
but I can't hurt you on purpose.
但我不能故意伤害你。

09:21.644 --> 09:24.605
You better hurt me,
or I'm really gonna hurt you!
你最好伤害我
不然我真的会伤害你！

09:24.689 --> 09:26.232
Well, OK.
好吧，好吧。

09:26.315 --> 09:29.235
Now don't hold back, SpongeBob,
just really let me have it.
现在别再犹豫了，海绵宝宝，
只是真的让我拥有它。

09:29.318 --> 09:31.237
Just remember, Squidward.
请记住，章鱼哥。

09:31.320 --> 09:34.323
This is going to hurt me more
than it's going to hurt you.
这会让我更加受伤
比它会伤害你。

09:34.991 --> 09:36.909
Um, OK, let me just memorize-
嗯，好吧，让我记住一下——

09:41.372 --> 09:42.999
Would you mind waiting till I-
你介意等我-

09:43.082 --> 09:46.335
Hang on, you're starting to
look like your old self again.
坚持住，你开始了
再次看起来像以前的自己。

09:46.919 --> 09:48.796
Nope, still too handsome.
不，还是太帅了。

09:49.380 --> 09:51.173
It's still not working.
它仍然不起作用。

09:51.257 --> 09:52.842
Maybe I'm not doing it
hard enough.
也许我没有这样做
够难的。

09:55.761 --> 09:57.680
Squidward: Let me-
章鱼哥：让我——

10:01.726 --> 10:03.436
Squidward, you're even
more handsome now.
章鱼哥，你还
现在更帅了。

10:04.770 --> 10:06.314
And that crowd is in a frenzy.
那群人正陷入疯狂。

10:06.397 --> 10:09.984
Well, SpongeBob, it was  you
who got me into this mess
嗯，海绵宝宝，就是你
谁让我陷入困境

10:10.067 --> 10:12.111
now  you  have to
get me out again.
现在你必须
再次让我出去。

10:12.194 --> 10:13.404
I know, Squidward.
我知道，章鱼哥。

10:13.487 --> 10:14.947
, I'll think
of something.
,我会想
的某事。

10:15.031 --> 10:17.450
, I just need,  ,
I just-
，我只需要，，
我只是——

10:25.791 --> 10:29.211
Squidward, look out for
that falling shoe!
章鱼哥，小心
那只掉下来的鞋子！

10:30.379 --> 10:32.089
Huh?
啊？

10:46.520 --> 10:47.938
Squidward...
章鱼哥...

10:50.816 --> 10:53.486
SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝...

10:53.569 --> 10:54.820
You're back.
你回来了。

10:54.904 --> 10:56.489
Oh, Squidward.
哦，章鱼哥。

10:56.572 --> 11:00.368
I love you no matter how many
times we smash your face.
我爱你无论有多少
有时我们会打碎你的脸。

11:00.451 --> 11:03.162
I almost wish
that meant something.
我几乎希望
这意味着什么。

11:06.916 --> 11:08.584
Hey, where you going?
嘿，你要去哪里？

11:08.668 --> 11:10.002
Don't leave me.
别离开我。

11:10.086 --> 11:11.587
Please, I'm begging you.
拜托，我求求你了。

11:11.670 --> 11:15.424
Look, I can make him
handsome again, watch.
瞧，我可以让他
又帅了，关注

11:15.508 --> 11:16.342
See?
看？

11:16.425 --> 11:18.177
He's getting handsome.
他越来越帅了

11:18.260 --> 11:21.180
It just...
takes a little... effort.
它只是...
需要一点……努力。

11:21.263 --> 11:23.682
Just a little... elbow grease.
只是一点点……肘部油脂。

11:23.766 --> 11:26.560
Please... come back...
请……回来吧……

11:47.706 --> 11:50.251
Neptune stirred up
quite a gale tonight.
海王星搅动了
今晚的风很大。

11:50.334 --> 11:52.294
He must be mad about something.
他一定是因为什么事情生气了。

11:54.922 --> 11:58.134
That's silly, everyone
knows Poseidon is ruler
of the undersea.
真是傻了大家
知道波塞冬是统治者
海底的。

11:58.968 --> 12:00.428
Ah, my leftovers.
啊，我的剩菜。

12:00.511 --> 12:04.056
: No...
： 不...

12:04.140 --> 12:06.183
Why, dear Neptune?
为什么，亲爱的海王星？

12:20.406 --> 12:21.740
Mm-hmm, goulash.
嗯嗯，炖牛肉。

12:21.824 --> 12:24.243
Hey, out there,
you dropped your goulash.
嘿，在外面，
you dropped your goulash.

12:24.326 --> 12:26.162
Hello...
你好...

12:29.707 --> 12:33.169
My pores are whistling
in the wind.
我的毛孔在呼啸
在风中。

13:12.708 --> 13:16.504
Aww, the little critter
likes my whistling pores.
哇哦，小动物
喜欢我呼啸的毛孔。

13:21.258 --> 13:25.179
That tickles.
那很痒。

13:25.262 --> 13:26.180
Deep Voice: Well...
低沉的声音：嗯……

13:26.263 --> 13:28.098
My shift's over.
我的轮班结束了。

13:29.391 --> 13:30.643
Time for work, SpongeBob.
工作时间到了，海绵宝宝。

13:30.726 --> 13:32.645
All right, jelly, out you go.
好吧，果冻，你出去吧。

13:34.897 --> 13:38.526
It's been real fun,
but I gotta get to work.
真的很有趣，
但我得去工作了。

13:38.609 --> 13:41.195
Quite a wind this morning,
Eh, jelly?
今天早上风好大
呃，果冻？

13:41.278 --> 13:43.447
Whoa...
哇...

13:45.574 --> 13:48.661
Hey, Sparky, can you
tell your friends I don't
have time to play right now?
嘿，斯帕克，你可以吗？
告诉你的朋友我不
现在有时间玩吗？

13:55.000 --> 13:58.254
Whoa...!
哇...！

14:05.761 --> 14:08.806
I told you guys
I don't have time to play.
我告诉过你们
我没时间玩。

14:12.893 --> 14:15.563
I have not been tardy one time
in my career as a fry cook.
我一次都没有迟到过
在我作为一名油炸厨师的职业生涯中。

14:15.646 --> 14:17.898
And I'm not gonna start today.
我今天不会开始。

14:28.951 --> 14:31.287
I need to call in some help.
我需要寻求帮助。

14:34.123 --> 14:37.126
My fingers are too big
for the buttons.
我的手指太大了
对于按钮。

14:39.795 --> 14:42.214
'ello, this be the Krusty Krab.
你好，这是蟹堡王。

14:42.298 --> 14:44.466
Mr. Krabs, I need you.
蟹老板，我需要你。

14:44.550 --> 14:45.968
SpongeBob, where you been?
海绵宝宝，你去哪儿了？

14:46.051 --> 14:49.513
Customers are blowing in here
like nobody's business.
顾客纷至沓来
就像没人管的事一样。

14:49.597 --> 14:53.601
I am sorry, Mr. Krabs,
but these jellyfish
don't want me to go to work.
对不起，蟹老板，
但这些水母
不想让我去上班。

14:53.684 --> 14:54.977
Jellyfish?
海蜇？

14:55.060 --> 14:57.563
They're attracted to my...
whistle-y holes.
他们被我的吸引...
口哨洞。

14:57.646 --> 14:58.939
Uh...
呃...

14:59.023 --> 15:01.275
I'll never understand
what you just said.
我永远不会明白
你刚才说的话。

15:01.358 --> 15:04.653
But if it's transportation
you need, I know just the thing.
但如果是交通的话
你需要的，我就知道。

15:08.449 --> 15:09.700
Got you.
明白你了。

15:09.783 --> 15:11.493
Ooh, this one's
putting up a fight.
噢，这个是
打架。

15:13.329 --> 15:14.455
Fightin' too hard.
打架太难了

15:16.206 --> 15:18.500
You're gonna reel him in, Krabs,
you've gotta wear him down.
你要把他卷起来，蟹蟹，
你得让他疲惫不堪。

15:19.710 --> 15:20.711
Give him a little slack.
给他一点松懈。

15:22.171 --> 15:24.381
Yank.
猛拉。

15:24.465 --> 15:26.133
A little slack...
有点松懈...

15:26.216 --> 15:27.134
And yank.
并猛拉。

15:30.554 --> 15:34.642
There he is, ready for work.
他就在那里，准备工作。

15:34.725 --> 15:37.519
Draw back that point,
now get in there and start
pushing out them patties.
拉回那个点，
现在进入那里并开始
把它们推出来。

15:37.603 --> 15:40.481
Aye-aye, sir.
是的，先生。

15:41.440 --> 15:45.444
Let's get these Patties
started right.
让我们来吃这些肉饼吧
开始是对的。

15:45.527 --> 15:47.988
Whoo.
呼。

15:48.947 --> 15:51.450
That gives me an idea.
这给了我一个想法。

15:58.499 --> 16:00.125
SpongeBob: Order up.
海绵宝宝：下单吧。

16:01.752 --> 16:03.629
Ooh...
哦...

16:15.015 --> 16:16.725
Ooh.
哦。

16:16.809 --> 16:18.811
Oh, no, they found me.
哦，不，他们找到了我。

16:20.896 --> 16:23.023
No, no-no, guys, please.
不，不，不，伙计们，拜托。

16:23.107 --> 16:24.817
Uh, would you mind coming back
after business hours?
呃，你介意回来吗
下班后？

16:24.900 --> 16:27.319
Heh, I'm trying to work here.
呵呵，我想在这里工作。

16:37.996 --> 16:40.499
Reporter: The weather situation
is much worse across
the country.
记者：天气情况
更糟糕的是
国家。

16:40.582 --> 16:44.503
And it doesn't look like
the winds are going to stop
anytime soon...
而且看起来并不像
风将会停止
很快...

16:46.255 --> 16:48.257
Fishy go bye-bye.
鱼儿要再见了。

16:51.427 --> 16:53.429
Ow.
噢。

16:53.512 --> 16:57.850
And that's the way it is
in your world today.
事情就是这样
今天在你的世界里。

16:57.933 --> 16:59.977
Boring.
无聊的。

17:00.060 --> 17:03.188
I don't want to watch
any of this boring stuff.
我不想看
任何这些无聊的事情。

17:03.272 --> 17:05.941
I want to watch
something decent, like-
我想看
一些像样的东西，比如——

17:06.024 --> 17:09.278
SpongeBob: Sorry, Patrick,
I need a place to hide
from those jellyfish.
海绵宝宝：对不起，帕特里克，
我需要一个地方躲起来
来自那些水母。

17:09.361 --> 17:10.279
What jellyfish?
什么水母？

17:10.362 --> 17:12.030
Ever since the winds started
自从起风了

17:12.114 --> 17:15.200
a sound whistles through
my holes that jellyfish
seem to love.
声音呼啸而过
我的水母洞
似乎很爱。

17:34.428 --> 17:35.345
Hey, pal.
嘿，朋友。

17:36.805 --> 17:39.475
SpongeBob, get out of here!
海绵宝宝，快离开这里！

17:39.558 --> 17:46.565
I'm sorry, SpongeBob, but you've
become a negative influence.
对不起，海绵宝宝，但你已经
成为负面影响。

17:47.941 --> 17:49.568
At least the wind stopped.
至少风停了。

18:03.665 --> 18:05.125
I think I lost 'em.
我想我失去了他们。

18:05.209 --> 18:09.671
Well, I guess I should just stay
in here, where it's safe.
好吧，我想我应该留下来
在这里，那里很安全。

18:09.755 --> 18:12.299
And quiet.
而且安静。

18:12.382 --> 18:13.342
And dark.
而且黑暗。

18:13.425 --> 18:14.718
Oh...
哦...

18:14.802 --> 18:17.596
It's OK, I'll only hide out here
for a second.
没关系，我就躲在这里
一会儿。

18:17.679 --> 18:18.931
Yeah, it shouldn't take long.
是的，应该不会花很长时间。

18:19.014 --> 18:20.682
Behind these rocks.
在这些岩石后面。

18:20.766 --> 18:23.560
These sedentary, lifeless rocks.
这些静止的、没有生命的岩石。

18:24.061 --> 18:25.521
Narrator: Later...
旁白：后来……

18:27.356 --> 18:29.316
Hey, buddy, just thought
I'd spruce you up a little.
嘿，伙计，只是想
我会让你打扮得漂亮一点。

18:29.399 --> 18:30.692
What's that?
那是什么？

18:30.776 --> 18:32.319
Ooh, you don't say.
呵呵，你不说。

18:32.402 --> 18:35.739
Well, guess what, you're my
best friend, too, mm-hmm.
好吧，你猜怎么着，你是我的
也是最好的朋友，嗯嗯。

18:35.823 --> 18:37.115
Come on, let's have some fun.
来吧，让我们玩得开心吧。

18:37.199 --> 18:39.368
Look, buddy, mm...
瞧，伙计，嗯……

18:39.451 --> 18:40.828
Dinner's ready.
晚餐准备好了。

18:40.911 --> 18:43.121
Here, let's have some tea.
来，我们喝点茶吧。

18:43.205 --> 18:44.957
Want some sugar, buddy, huh?
哥们，要吃糖吗？

18:45.040 --> 18:46.959
One lump or two?
一块还是两块？

18:47.042 --> 18:48.585
Oh, you can have it all.
哦，你可以拥有这一切。

18:49.837 --> 18:52.840
I feel comfortable around you.
在你身边我感觉很舒服。

18:54.842 --> 18:57.177
Can I confess something,
'cause I know you'll understand.
我可以坦白一件事吗
因为我知道你会理解的。

18:57.261 --> 18:59.388
I have this... problem.
我有这个...问题。

18:59.471 --> 19:02.516
I seem to attract jellyfish.
我似乎吸引了水母。

19:02.599 --> 19:04.893
Huh, how do you handle
a thing like that, hmm?
呵呵，你怎么处理
类似的事情，嗯？

19:07.145 --> 19:08.897
Yeah, yeah, I'm at a loss, too.
是啊是啊，我也很失落。

19:08.981 --> 19:10.399
Oh, barnacles!
哦，藤壶！

19:10.482 --> 19:14.194
I'm gonna be
stuck in this cave forever!
我会是
永远被困在这个山洞里了！

19:18.907 --> 19:21.869
Of course, buddy,
brilliant idea.
当然，哥们，
绝妙的主意。

19:23.996 --> 19:26.582
We'll see what happens
this time.
我们看看会发生什么
这次。

19:31.086 --> 19:33.088
Oh, here they come.
哦，他们来了。

19:33.172 --> 19:35.424
Go get 'em, buddy.
去找他们吧，伙计。

19:57.195 --> 19:59.031
What do you think of
my little friend's song?
你觉得怎么样
我小朋友的歌？

20:03.035 --> 20:04.036
Something wrong?
有事吗？

20:08.957 --> 20:13.295
Hmm, I created one stone
SpongeBob that uttered a note
in a foul key.
嗯，我创造了一颗石头
海绵宝宝发出了一张纸条
以犯规的方式。

20:13.378 --> 20:16.506
But if I were to craft another
in a different size
但如果我要制作另一个
不同尺寸

20:16.590 --> 20:18.425
the dimensions of
that hollow center
的尺寸
那个空心的中心

20:18.508 --> 20:20.636
multiplied by
the number of holes
乘以
孔数

20:20.719 --> 20:22.054
may offer another tune.
可能会提供另一种曲调。

20:22.137 --> 20:24.264
One that could
soothe those jellyfish.
一个可以
安抚那些水母。

20:24.348 --> 20:27.726
But which one is the right size?
但哪一种尺寸合适呢？

20:27.809 --> 20:30.062
Eh, I guess I'll just
have to make a bunch of 'em.
呃，我想我只会
必须做一堆。

20:48.246 --> 20:50.457
OK, that should do her.
好吧，那应该可以了。

21:21.863 --> 21:24.700
Whoa, it actually worked.
哇，它确实有效。

21:28.954 --> 21:30.789
I can go back to work now.
我现在可以回去工作了。

21:33.083 --> 21:35.627
Krusty Krab, here I come.
蟹堡王我来了

21:37.754 --> 21:40.799
How long was I gone?
我走了多久？

21:40.882 --> 21:43.468
No...!
不...！

21:43.552 --> 21:46.722
No...
不...

21:49.933 --> 21:52.644
Narrator: 3,000 years later.
旁白：3000年后。

21:59.484 --> 22:04.781
Woman: To this day, no one knows
why these mysterious statues
were created, or by whom.
女：至今无人知晓
为什么这些神秘的雕像
是被创造的，或者是由谁创造的。

22:06.408 --> 22:08.827
All we know is
the genius of their design
我们所知道的是
他们的设计天才

22:08.910 --> 22:13.749
has caused the annual migration
of jellyfish to their
wondrous tune.
引起了每年的迁徙
水母给他们的
美妙的曲调。

引起了每年的迁徙
水母给他们的
美妙的曲调。